      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Went with a 6.6kw Fronius Primo Smart inverter setup with longi panels.The quoting process surprised me with their knowledge and assistance to get the right package for me with a great price.Always very polite/friendly. Informative and timely installation, was so professional and efficient. The team really know what they're doing.I was connected to the grid faster than anticipated and immediate queries regarding the smart system I got installed were taken care of in a very timely manner.The customer service and aftersales assistance is very comforting and reassuring, not to mention knowledgeable.I doubt there is a question they can't answer. The knowledge level of immediate  staff is impeccable. Jamie is extremely experienced and a pleasure to talk to. Great people, great family business that are local. So happy I used their services.Many thanks, Steve.",
