      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Recently purchased a full off grid Solar system from Harelec with 12Kw of panels and 20kWh of battery storage. It was a pleasure working with them, they were honest and forthright when making recommendations; took time to understand my requirements and were very clear about what I could expect from the different options available to me. I spent quite a bit of time communicating back and forth as I worked through my options and they were always on hand to answer my questions with no sales pressure to commit to an order until I was ready. I found them to be extremely professional to work with and my system was installed on time and perfectly the first time. The Harelec team were passionately committed to the best end result for me as a customer and went above and beyond my expectations to ensure I got the best solution and service possible. I highly recommend Harelec to anyone interested in a solar installation.",
